      "message": "Probably not for this change, but I find it odd we\u0027re overwriting the CoD when there\u0027s a function (btif_dm_get_local_class_of_device) that fetches the CoD from a system property + other logic, which is ultimately used to write the CoD to the HW.\n\nWe might want to validate this logic and see if we really need it, or if this is the place to be auto-magical with the CoD",
